# PRICEALERTER – COMPLETE WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT MASTER PROMPT

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, production-ready, next-generation Indian financial intelligence platform called PRICEALERTER.

Website: https://pricealerter.in

The platform provides Indian investors with a comprehensive interface to discover IPOs, track IPO Grey Market Premium (GMP), monitor NSE and BSE listed companies, analyse listing performance, explore financial information and understand the stock market.

This is not just an IPO listing website. It must become a comprehensive financial information and analytics platform.

Create an entirely new, original, premium UI/UX design.

Do not clone Groww, Zerodha, IPOWatch, Chittorgarh, Moneycontrol or any other website. Use them only as broad usability references. Create a distinct PriceAlerter visual identity.

The final website must be:
- Visually premium.
- Information-rich.
- Fast and responsive.
- Search-engine friendly.
- Data-driven.
- Easy to navigate.
- Accessible.
- Scalable.
- Mobile-friendly.
- Ready for real data integration.

Do not create a static mockup. Implement working navigation, filters, tables, search, charts, calculations and user interactions.

